<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-sanguozhi" book-id="b-sanguozhi-053" chapter-id="c-sanguozhi-053-peixuan" source-id="s-sanguozhi-053-peixuan">
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-053-peixuan:line024" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">　　<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-peixuan:line024:m0002" ref="pll_n3c_og5">玄</persName>字<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-peixuan:line024:m0004" ref="pll_n3c_og5">彥黃</persName>，下邳人也，亦有學行，官至太中大夫。問子<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-peixuan:line024:m0026" ref="5fh_6gh_stc">欽</persName><persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-peixuan:line024:m0027" ref="9w2_c77_53m">齊桓</persName>、<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-peixuan:line024:m0030" ref="6di_ywz_ju4_AAA">晉文</persName>、<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-peixuan:line024:m0033" ref="eh7_raa_ap6">夷</persName>、<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-peixuan:line024:m0035" ref="myy_zdg_6b6">惠</persName>四人優劣，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-peixuan:line024:m0041" ref="5fh_6gh_stc">欽</persName>答所見，與<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-peixuan:line024:m0047" ref="pll_n3c_og5">玄</persName>相反覆，各有文理。<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-peixuan:line024:m0057" ref="5fh_6gh_stc">欽</persName>與<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-peixuan:line024:m0059" ref="572_278_cba_C">太子登</persName>遊處，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-peixuan:line024:m0065" ref="572_278_cba_C">登</persName>稱其翰採。</p>
</text>
